[00:10.06]Men make gods of wood and stone,
[00:14.10]But the true God they’ve not known.
[00:18.86]He is God Almighty,
[00:23.74]As he’s often shown.
[00:27.92]Other gods just cannot see
[00:32.48]What in future days will be.
[00:37.48]For witnesses they look all in vain,
[00:42.06]Since none their godship can maintain.
[00:46.77](Chorus)
[00:46.92]We’re Jehovah’s Witnesses.
[00:51.28]We speak out in fearlessness.
[00:55.98]Ours is the God of true prophecy;
[01:00.60]What he foretells comes to be.
[01:12.39]Proudly we declare God’s name,
[01:16.72]Bearing witness to his fame.
[01:21.43]News about his Kingdom,
[01:25.53]Boldly we proclaim.
[01:30.55]We help others come to see
[01:34.25]How the truth can set them free.
[01:39.80]As they grow strong, their voices they’ll raise,
[01:44.45]Singing to God this song of praise.
[01:48.98](Chorus)
[01:49.13]We’re Jehovah’s Witnesses.
[01:53.65]We speak out in fearlessness.
[01:58.27]Ours is the God of true prophecy;
[02:02.85]What he foretells comes to be.
[02:07.59]Witnessing exalts God’s name,
[02:11.69]Lifts therefrom reproach and shame.
[02:16.71]And it warns the wicked,
[02:21.45]Who God’s name defame.
[02:25.63]Pardon it holds out to men,
[02:30.58]If they turn to God again.
[02:35.23]Whole-souled devotion brings joy and peace;
[02:40.59]Promise of life that will not cease.
[02:43.84](Chorus)
[02:43.99]We’re Jehovah’s Witnesses.
[02:48.91]We speak out in fearlessness.
[02:53.69]Ours is the God of true prophecy;
[02:58.29]What he foretells comes to be.
